This package lists term names and identifiers from third-party vocabularies in schemas/:
- Darwin Core (TDWG), CC BY 4.0, and Dublin Core Terms (DCMI).
- CGI Simple Lithology, CGI Geoscience Terminology Working Group, CC BY 4.0,
  https://github.com/CGI-IUGS/cgi-vocabs
- International Chronostratigraphic Chart, International Commission on Stratigraphy
  (www.stratigraphy.org), referenced by IRI only. The ICS chart is under the ICS
  permissions policy (non-commercial, unmodified use), not CC BY, so its unit labels are
  not redistributed in the vocabulary files pending permission. Cohen, K.M., Finney, S.M.,
  Gibbard, P.L., Fan, J.-X., 2013. The ICS International Chronostratigraphic Chart.
  Episodes 36, 199-204.
- NERC Vocabulary Server collection S10, British Oceanographic Data Centre, CC BY 4.0.
- ENVO and NCBITaxon (OBO Foundry), CC0 1.0. NCBI Taxonomy: Federhen S. 2012, The NCBI
  Taxonomy database, Nucleic Acids Research 40, D136-D143.
- OGC coordinate reference system identifiers, AAVSO filter codes and UDUNITS spellings:
  licences not checked.
Names and identifiers are unchanged except where noted. What was taken, from where, and the
